<title>SINGAPORE: Nobel Design's IPO 124.75 times subscribed - DBS.</title>
<headline>Nobel Design's IPO 124.75 times subscribed - DBS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nobel Design Holdings Ltd's initial public offer (IPO) has been subscribed 124.75 times, said a spokesman from lead manager Development Bank of Singapore on Thursday.  </p>
<p>Nobel, an interior design and furniture group, had offered 15 million shares to the public at Singapore $0.33 each. Another five million shares at the same price were placed out.</p>
<p>Trading on a &quot;when issued&quot; basis will start on November 25. The shares will be listed on the second board SESDAQ of the Stock Exchange of Singapore.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
